<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Atlantic Richfield cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Atlantic Richfield cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said Friday analyst Mark Hastings had cut his rating for Atlantic Richfield Co to near-term neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Hastings kept the company as long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Los Angeles oil company closed Thursday at 145-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
